---
// HighConversionFeatures.astro
---

<section id="ferramentas-conversao" class="py-24 text-brand-dark overflow-hidden relative bg-white">
  <!-- Sunny Yellow Glow Background -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-60" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, #FFF991 0%, transparent 70%); mix-blend-mode: multiply;" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Cabeçalho da Seção -->
    <div class="text-center mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black mb-6 tracking-tighter text-brand-dark">
        FERRAMENTAS PARA <span class="text-brand-yellow">ALTA CONVERSÃO</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-brand-text/70 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Proteja seu tráfego, acompanhe suas vendas e publique páginas prontas para converter.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Seção: RATOEIRA ADS -->
    <div class="mb-32">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-12">
        <div class="h-px bg-brand-yellow/30 grow"></div>
        <span class="text-brand-yellow font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-xs px-4 py-2 border border-brand-yellow/30 rounded-full bg-brand-yellow/5">Ratoeira Ads</span>
        <div class="h-px bg-brand-yellow/30 grow"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8">
        <!-- Feature Ads 1 -->
        <div class="card-feature group bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 md:p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-black/5 hover:border-brand-yellow/40 transition-all duration-500 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8">
          <div class="relative z-10 flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors italic uppercase leading-none">
              TRACKEAMENTO AVANÇADO<br>SERVER-SIDE
            </h3>
            <p class="text-brand-text/70 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md">
              O tracking server-side envia conversões pela API do Google. GCLID e UTMs preservados ajudam a ligar cada venda à campanha, ao anúncio e à palavra-chave de origem.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full max-w-md flex-1 transform transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105">
            <img 
              src="/images/features/tracking-server-side.webp"
              alt="Fluxo de conversões enviadas ao Google Ads por tracking server-side"
              class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-all"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="absolute -bottom-10 -left-10 w-40 h-40 bg-brand-yellow/5 rounded-full blur-[60px] group-hover:bg-brand-yellow/10 transition-all"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-feature group bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 md:p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-black/5 hover:border-brand-yellow/40 transition-all duration-500 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-8">
          <div class="relative z-10 flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors italic uppercase leading-none">DADO<br>ENRIQUECIDO</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-text/70 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md">A Ratoeira não envia só o evento — envia o sinal enriquecido. Dados primários tratados e protegidos, como e-mail e telefone, vão pela API de Conversões. O Google casa mais vendas ao clique que as gerou e o Smart Bidding passa a mirar quem compra.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full max-w-md flex-1 transform transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105">
            <img src="/images/features/conversoesotimizadas.webp" alt="Envio de conversões com dados enriquecidos pela API de Conversões" class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-all" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-feature group bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 md:p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-black/5 hover:border-brand-yellow/40 transition-all duration-500 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8">
          <div class="relative z-10 flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors italic uppercase leading-none">FUNIL<br>COMPLETO</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-text/70 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md">Outras ferramentas mostram de onde vieram os cliques. A Ratoeira mostra de onde vieram as vendas — visitas, leads e conversões integradas num lugar só.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full max-w-md flex-1 transform transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105">
            <img src="/images/features/funil.webp" alt="Funil de visitas, leads e vendas no Ratoeira Ads" class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-all" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-feature group bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 md:p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-black/5 hover:border-brand-yellow/40 transition-all duration-500 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-8">
          <div class="relative z-10 flex-1">
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-black mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors italic uppercase leading-none">ENVIOS CAPI<br>100% AUDITÁVEIS</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-text/70 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md">Cada evento sai para a API de Conversões com os parâmetros de atribuição e com deduplicação contra o pixel do navegador. Cada envio fica registrado no painel para consulta individual.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full max-w-md flex-1 transform transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105">
            <img src="/images/features/serveraside.png" alt="Registro de conversões no painel da Ratoeira Ads" class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] transition-all" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- Feature Ads 3 (Full Width) -->
      <div class="mt-8 card-feature group bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 md:p-12 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-black/5 hover:border-brand-yellow/40 transition-all duration-500 shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
        <div class="flex-1 relative z-10">
          <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-6 group-hover:text-brand-yellow transition-colors italic uppercase leading-tight">
            DADOS EM<br>TEMPO REAL
          </h3>
          <p class="text-brand-text/70 text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            O Google Ads demora para consolidar conversão, e nesse intervalo o algoritmo otimiza para o público errado. A Ratoeira mostra impressões, cliques, CPC, ROAS, conversões e receita antes do próprio painel do Google — e cruza com suas plataformas de venda para você decidir o que escalar.
          </p>
          <a href="#planos" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-dark text-white font-black px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-sm uppercase tracking-tighter hover:bg-brand-yellow hover:text-brand-dark transition-all group-hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,184,0,0.3)]">
            Explorar Dashboard
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M14 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 transform transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105">
          <img 
            src="/images/features/dashboard-ads.png"
            alt="Dashboard financeiro do Ratoeira Ads"
            class="w-full rounded-3xl shadow-2xl border border-black/5"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card-feature group mt-8 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-8 shadow-lg md:p-12">
        <div class="grid items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-12">
          <div class="lg:order-2">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase text-brand-dark md:text-3xl">MCP Ratoeira Ads</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-dark/75 md:text-lg">
              Conecte seus dados da Ratoeira Ads ao Claude ou ChatGPT por MCP. Consulte a operação e execute ações em linguagem natural, sem abrir o painel.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 rounded-2xl bg-white px-5 py-4 text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed text-brand-dark shadow-sm md:text-base">
              “Qual campanha teve o melhor ROAS esta semana?”
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-dark md:text-base">
              <li class="rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-3">Consulte ROAS, CPA e performance por período.</li>
              <li class="rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-3">Pause ou ative campanhas e ajuste o orçamento pelo chat.</li>
              <li class="rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-3">Liste campanhas ativas e confira os IPs bloqueados.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-black/10 bg-white shadow-2xl transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02] lg:order-1">
            <img src="/images/features/mcp-ads.png" alt="Gerenciador de campanhas do Ratoeira Ads" class="block h-auto w-full" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Seção: RATOEIRA PAGES -->
    <div class="mb-20">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-12">
        <div class="h-px bg-orange-600/20 grow"></div>
        <span class="text-orange-600 font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-xs px-4 py-2 border border-orange-600/20 rounded-full bg-orange-600/5">Ratoeira Pages</span>
        <div class="h-px bg-orange-600/20 grow"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        
        <!-- Feature Pages 1: Flash Pages (Destaque com Imagem) -->
        <div class="card-feature group bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 md:p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-black/5 hover:border-orange-600/40 transition-all duration-500 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:col-span-2">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 h-full items-center">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-orange-600/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-orange-600/20 group-hover:bg-orange-600/20 transition-colors">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-orange-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-black mb-4 italic uppercase text-brand-dark group-hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors leading-tight">FLASH PAGES</h3>
              <p class="text-brand-text/70 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Criação e Validação em Tempo Recorde. Coloque sua oferta no ar enquanto seus concorrentes ainda estão configurando o servidor.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 w-full max-w-md">
              <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-black/10 shadow-2xl transform group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500 bg-brand-dark/5">
                <img src="/images/features/flash-pages.png" alt="Interface Flash Pages" class="w-full h-auto block" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-black/20 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature Pages 2: Connect Rate -->
        <div class="card-feature group bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 md:p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-black/5 hover:border-orange-600/40 transition-all duration-500 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:col-span-2">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse gap-8 h-full items-center">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-orange-600/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-orange-600/20 group-hover:bg-orange-600/20 transition-colors">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-orange-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20 16.6A4.5 4.5 0 0017.5 8a6 6 0 00-11.8 1.5A4 4 0 007 17h10a4 4 0 003-0.4z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-black mb-4 italic uppercase text-brand-dark group-hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors leading-tight">CONNECT RATE ALTO NA CLOUDFLARE</h3>
              <p class="text-brand-text/70 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
                As páginas rodam na borda da Cloudflare, com cache global e certificado próprio. A página abre antes de o clique esfriar — e connect rate alto é o que separa a visita que entra no seu relatório da visita que você pagou e nunca viu, principalmente em native e no mobile.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 w-full max-w-md">
              <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-black/10 shadow-2xl transform group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500 bg-brand-dark/5">
                <img src="/images/features/connect-rate.svg" alt="Diagrama de uma página entregue pela borda da rede" class="w-full h-auto block" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-black/20 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature Pages 3: Teste A/B -->
        <div class="card-feature group bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 md:p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-black/5 hover:border-orange-600/40 transition-all duration-500 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:col-span-2">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 h-full items-center">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-orange-600/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-orange-600/20 group-hover:bg-orange-600/20 transition-colors">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-orange-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 5h6v6H4zM14 13h6v6h-6zM10 8h4m-2 0v8m-2 0h4"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-black mb-4 italic uppercase text-brand-dark group-hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors leading-tight">TESTE A/B NATIVO NO SERVIDOR</h3>
              <p class="text-brand-text/70 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Crie variações da página e divida o tráfego no próprio servidor, sem script de redirect rodando no navegador. Impressões, conversões, taxa e receita em tempo real, sem ferramenta externa e sem o flicker que entrega o teste para o visitante.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 w-full max-w-md">
              <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-black/10 shadow-2xl transform group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500 bg-brand-dark/5">
                <img src="/images/features/testab.png" alt="Painel de teste A/B da Ratoeira Pages com variantes e resultados" class="w-full h-auto block" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-black/20 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature Pages 4: Clonador de Páginas (Destaque com Imagem) -->
        <div class="card-feature group bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 md:p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-black/5 hover:border-orange-600/40 transition-all duration-500 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:col-span-2">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row-reverse gap-8 h-full items-center">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-orange-600/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-orange-600/20 group-hover:bg-orange-600/20 transition-colors">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-orange-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7v8a2 2 0 002 2h6M8 7V5a2 2 0 012-2h4.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l4.414 4.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V15a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2M8 7H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h8a2 2 0 002-2v-2"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-black mb-4 italic uppercase text-brand-dark group-hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors leading-tight">CLONADOR DE PÁGINAS</h3>
              <p class="text-brand-text/70 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Cole a URL de uma página para replicar sua estrutura e depois ajuste textos, imagens e cores no editor visual.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 w-full max-w-md">
              <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-black/10 shadow-2xl transform group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500 bg-brand-dark/5">
                <img src="/images/features/clonador.png" alt="Interface Clonador de Páginas" class="w-full h-auto block" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-black/20 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature Pages 5: Integração Ratoeira Ads (Destaque com Imagem) -->
        <div class="card-feature group bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 md:p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-black/5 hover:border-orange-600/40 transition-all duration-500 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:col-span-2">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 h-full items-center">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-orange-600/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-orange-600/20 group-hover:bg-orange-600/20 transition-colors">
                <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-orange-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-black mb-4 italic uppercase text-brand-dark group-hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors leading-tight">INTEGRAÇÃO RATOEIRA ADS</h3>
              <p class="text-brand-text/70 text-base leading-relaxed mb-6">
                Cada página criada na Ratoeira Pages já vem com o script do Ratoeira Ads integrado. Publique e comece a acompanhar o caminho do clique à conversão sem instalação manual.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 w-full max-w-md">
              <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-black/10 shadow-2xl transform group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500 bg-brand-dark/5">
                <img src="/images/features/integracao.png" alt="Interface Integrações Ratoeira Ads" class="w-full h-auto block" />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-t from-black/20 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="card-feature group mt-8 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-orange-200 bg-orange-50 p-8 shadow-lg md:p-12">
        <div class="grid items-center gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-12">
          <div class="lg:order-2">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase text-brand-dark md:text-3xl">MCP Ratoeira Pages</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-dark/75 md:text-lg">
              Com o MCP da Ratoeira Pages no Claude, descreva a página que quer criar. Depois, consulte os resultados e gerencie a publicação pelo chat.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-6 rounded-2xl bg-white px-5 py-4 text-sm font-semibold leading-relaxed text-brand-dark shadow-sm md:text-base">
              “Crie uma Flash Page de presell para minha oferta.”
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-dark md:text-base">
              <li class="rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-3">Crie páginas por descrição ou clone uma página existente.</li>
              <li class="rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-3">Publique, despublique e consulte domínios conectados.</li>
              <li class="rounded-xl bg-white px-5 py-3">Pergunte sobre visitas, origem do tráfego e conversões.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-black/10 bg-white shadow-2xl transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[1.02] lg:order-1">
            <img src="/images/features/mcp-pages.png" alt="Interface de criação de páginas com IA no Ratoeira Pages" class="block h-auto w-full" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA Final Unificado -->
    <div class="mt-20 text-center">
      <a href="#planos" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-linear-to-r from-brand-yellow to-orange-600 text-brand-dark font-black text-sm md:text-xl py-6 px-8 md:px-12 rounded-full transition-all duration-500 shadow-[0_10px_50px_rgba(255,184,0,0.2)] hover:shadow-[0_20px_80px_rgba(255,184,0,0.4)] hover:-translate-y-2 group whitespace-nowrap">
        QUERO O ARSENAL COMPLETO
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 md:w-6 md:h-6 transform transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"></path></svg>
      </a>
      <p class="mt-6 text-brand-text/60 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Preços por lote até 30 de novembro</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @reference "../styles/global.css";

  .card-feature {
    @apply transition-all duration-500;
  }
  .card-feature:hover {
    @apply -translate-y-2;
  }
</style>
